./batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是一阶语言（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\iota\\in{}^\\kappa\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\iota\\in{}^\\kappa\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s_0)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\iota,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\iota,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(n)}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(n)}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\kappa]^n_{\\uparrow}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar\\alpha\\in\\kappa^n:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\;(\\alpha_i&lt;\\alpha_j)\\}\">\\([\\kappa]^n_{\\uparrow}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar\\alpha\\in\\kappa^n:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\;(\\alpha_i&lt;\\alpha_j)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(t,s,\\bar a,n,\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(t,s,\\bar a,n,\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>（本文件定义的有限赋值更新关系，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a> 的单变量更新）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indisc}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{Indisc}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indiscernible}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Indiscernible}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本文件定义；七元谓词保留选定满足递归）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indiscernible\\text{-}finite\\text{-}update}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(t,s,\\bar a,n,\\mathfrak A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,n,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(u,n+1,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\bigr)\n\\land u(0)=s\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{21mm}\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(u(i+1)=u(i)[v_i\\mapsto\\bar a(i)]\\bigr)\n\\land t=u(n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indiscernible\\text{-}finite\\text{-}update}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(t,s,\\bar a,n,\\mathfrak A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,n,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(u,n+1,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\bigr)\n\\land u(0)=s\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{21mm}\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(u(i+1)=u(i)[v_i\\mapsto\\bar a(i)]\\bigr)\n\\land t=u(n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indiscernible\\text{-}selected}\\vdash{}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Indisc}_S(\\iota,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\iota,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(n)}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar\\alpha,\\bar\\beta\\in[\\kappa]^n_{\\uparrow}\\;\n\\exists s_\\alpha,s_\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(s_\\alpha,s_0,\\iota\\circ\\bar\\alpha,n,\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(s_\\beta,s_0,\\iota\\circ\\bar\\beta,n,\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s_\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s_\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indiscernible\\text{-}selected}\\vdash{}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Indisc}_S(\\iota,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(\\iota,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(n)}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar\\alpha,\\bar\\beta\\in[\\kappa]^n_{\\uparrow}\\;\n\\exists s_\\alpha,s_\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(s_\\alpha,s_0,\\iota\\circ\\bar\\alpha,n,\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(s_\\beta,s_0,\\iota\\circ\\bar\\beta,n,\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s_\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s_\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indiscernible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Indiscernible}_S(\\iota,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{Indisc}_S(\\iota,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indiscernible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Indiscernible}_S(\\iota,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{Indisc}_S(\\iota,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\kappa;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Indiscernibles are elements that cannot be distinguished by formulas in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>满足递归与基础赋值进入七元谓词签名；有限更新由赋值图序列递归实现，自由变量之外的值因单变量更新定义而保持为同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\">\\(s_0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>In <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, the existence of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^{\\sharp}\">\\(0^{\\sharp}\\)</span> implies the existence of a class of ordinal indiscernibles.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/5